orial Section -->\n  <div class=\"tutorial-section\">\n    <div class=\"tutorial-title\">电工工具使用小教程</div>\n    <div class=\"tutorial-grid\">\n      <!-- Tutorial 1 -->\n      <div class=\"tutorial-card\">\n        <div class=\"tutorial-card-header\">1. 测电笔使用</div>\n        <div class=\"tutorial-image\"><div class=\"placeholder\">[测电笔使用图]</div></div>\n        <div class=\"tutorial-desc\">手指接触笔尾金属，笔尖接触插孔，管亮表示该孔为火线。</div>\n      </div>\n      <!-- Tutorial 2 -->\n      <div class=\"tutorial-card\">\n        <div class=\"tutorial-card-header\">2. 剥线钳使用</div>\n        <div class=\"tutorial-image\"><div class=\"placeholder\">[剥线钳使用图]</div></div>\n        <div class=\"tutorial-desc\">将导线放入对应线号的剥线口，轻压旋转即可剥离绝缘层。</div>\n      </div>\n      <!-- Tutorial 3 -->\n      <div class=\"tutorial-card\">\n        <div class=\"tutorial-card-header\">3. 万用表测电压</div>\n        <div class=\"tutorial-image\"><div class=\"placeholder\">[万用表测电压 2200]</div></div>\n        <div class=\"tutorial-desc\">调至交流电压档，将表笔分别接触火线和零线，读数即为电压值。</div>\n      </div>\n      <!-- Tutorial 4 -->\n      <div class=\"tutorial-card\">\n        <div class=\"tutorial-card-header\">4. 电烙铁焊接</div>\n        <div class=\"tutorial-image\"><div class=\"placeholder\">[电烙铁焊接图]</div></div>\n        <div class=\"tutorial-desc\">电烙铁加热后，先加热焊点，再送入焊锡丝，待焊锡融化后移开焊锡丝。</div>\n      </div>\n      <!-- Tutorial 5 -->\n      <div class=\"tutorial-card\">\n        <div class=\"tutorial-card-header\">5. 绝缘胶带包扎</div>\n        <div class=\"tutorial-image\"><div class=\"placeholder\">[绝缘胶带包扎图]</div></div>\n        <div class=\"tutorial-desc\">将胶带拉紧缠绕在接头处，覆盖所有裸露导体，确保绝缘可靠。</div>\n      </div>\n      <!-- Tutorial 6 -->\n      <div class=\"tutorial-card\">\n        <div class=\"tutorial-card-header\">6. 热缩管使用</div>\n        <div class=\"tutorial-image\"><div class=\"placeholder\">[热缩管使用图]</div></div>\n        <div class=\"tutorial-desc\">将热缩管套在接头处，用热风枪加热均匀，直至完全收缩贴合。</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Safety Section -->\n  <div clas